    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## The Green Gardener: Designing for Sam\r\n\r\n**The User:** Sam needs a digital plant-tracking app with a built-in watering schedule. He is often outside, in direct sunlight, with dirt on his hands while using the app.\r\n\r\n**Your Task:** Write a detailed prompt for AI Tutor to help you generate your web app layout. Your prompt must address the following three questions:\r\n\r\n1. What is the goal?   \r\n> Think about: What information (e.g. plant type, watering schedule, ready to harvest) does the app keep track of?\r\n\r\n2. What are the constraints?\r\n> What colors, buttons, and text should the page use to be visible in extreme sunlight?\r\n\r\n3. What are the edge cases?\r\n>How should the website handle missing information (e.g. no known watering schedule, missing picture of a plant)?\r\n",
